Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:34:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Filter phone tilt during pose tracking and debounce safety
 estop.

Pose updates were applying hand rotation 1:1 onto the wrist while the three-joint IK chased the gripper, so a shaky translation slewed diagonally and tripped the 10 cm estop. Yaw no longer maps into the wrist, pose tilt below 8 degrees is ignored, and tracking error must persist for 15 steps before estop.
